          "text": "To <span class=\"ul-b\">plot a straight line</span>, substitute values of x into the equation to find corresponding y-values. Plot these <span class=\"ul-k\">coordinate pairs</span> and join with a ruler."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "<span class=\"rb\">Tip:</span> You only need two points to draw a line, but use three to check for errors."
        }
      ]
